sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant UC as CalculatePriceUseCase
    participant Config as PriceConfiguration
    participant Rule as PricingRule
    
    Client->>UC: execute(request)
    note right of UC: Fetch configuration (mocked)
    UC->>Config: calculateFinalPrice(basePrice)
    loop For each active rule
        Config->>Rule: calculate(basePrice)
        Rule-->>Config: adjustment amount
    end
    Config-->>UC: finalPrice
    UC-->>Client: response
